  "title": {
    "zh_CN": "第五课 · 跳音与音程",
    "en_US": "Lesson 5 · Leaps and intervals"
  },
  "goal": {
    "zh_CN": "听清三度、五度距离，唱准跳进后回到起音。",
    "en_US": "Hear thirds and fifths and return accurately after a leap."
  },
  "steps": {
    "zh_CN": "1. 先听 1–3–1，再听 1–5–1。\n2. 不靠喊响去唱高音，保持舒适音量。\n3. 循环三音一组，再练 2–4–2、3–5–3。\n4. 到听力页练音程辨别和短句模唱。",
    "en_US": "1. Hear 1–3–1, then 1–5–1.\n2. Keep a comfortable volume on higher notes.\n3. Loop each group, then practise 2–4–2 and 3–5–3.\n4. Use interval questions and phrase echo."
  },
  "selfCheck": {
    "zh_CN": "回到起音时是否仍唱准？跳进是否唱成相邻音？",
    "en_US": "Is the returning note accurate? Did a leap become a step?"
  },
